# 31. Nuvarande mentala modell av algoritmen

En vanlig node fungerar nu konceptuellt så här:

```text
receive excess
      |
      v
become active
      |
      v
pending = adj
      |
      v
try edge
      |
      +---- no capacity ------> next edge
      |
      v
send push_request
      |
      v
wait for response
      |
      +---- rejected ---------> next edge
      |
      v
accepted
      |
      v
reduce own excess
      |
      v
e == 0 ?
   |       |
  yes      no
   |       |
   v       v
 wait /   continue
 finish   discharge

If pending empty and e > 0:
      |
      v
    relabel
      |
      v
 pending = adj
      |
      v
try again
```

Termination kör parallellt med detta:

```text
A activates B

A.outstanding += 1
B.parent = A

B finishes own work
B.outstanding == 0

B -> termination_ack -> A

A.outstanding -= 1
```

Till slut:

```text
Source.outstanding == 0

Source -> computation_finished -> Controller

Controller -> get_excess -> Sink

f = sink.e
```

